For my individual contribution, I was responsible for creating all of the CAD models for the project. I was also responsible for preparing the parts to be cut out and making sure the designs could be used for our robots. Although we ended up making the final parts out of cardboard instead of laser cutting them, the CAD model still served as the guide for constructing each piece. I also helped with assembling the parts and making adjustments so the design worked properly on the robot.
